---
import Paragraph from "../components/Paragraph.astro";
import Button from "../components/Button.astro";
import MainLayout from "../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
---

<MainLayout title="About Us" description="Geminii Robotics was established in 2026 as an affiliate team of Ultro Robotics, founded by twins Nate and Brandon. Learn more about our team and sponsorship.">
	<Paragraph slot="subtitle">
		Geminii was established in 2026 as an affiliate team of Ultro Robotics.
		The team was founded by twins Nate and Brandon, hence the name Geminii,
		meaning “twins” in Latin. The team centers around training the next
		generation of engineers and leaders for Ultro, and we are excited to see
		how the team performs in our first FTC season.
	</Paragraph>
	<hr class="mx-auto w-9/10 max-w-144 border-t-2 border-geminii-600" />
	<section class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center py-8">
		<h2 class="text-white text-4xl font-display font-extrabold m-4">
			Sponsors
		</h2>
		<div class="max-w-9/10 text-center mb-10 flex flex-col items-center justify-center">
			<Paragraph className="mb-4">
				While Geminii is affiliated with the Browning School,
				<strong>we are entirely self-funded.</strong> Our finances are
				also handled by the students to increase our accountability and
				fiscal responsibility. Please contact us if you would like to
				sponsor us.
			</Paragraph>
			<Button text="SPONSOR US" href="mailto:geminii-robotics@browning.edu" />
		</div>
	</section>
</MainLayout>
